<title>USA: Morgan Products sees Q2 net loss of $0.20.</title>
<headline>Morgan Products sees Q2 net loss of $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Products said Tuesday that after restructuring charges, it expects to report a net loss of about $0.20 per share for the second quarter.</p>
<p>The company said its operating results for the second and third quarters will be lower than expected.</p>
<p>Morgan expects to report about income per share of about $0.06 to $0.10 before restructuring charges for the second quarter ending June 30.</p>
<p>The company does not expect to incur further restructuring charges in the current fiscal year.</p>
</text>
